<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Indian Fury 4 - The Gate of Tears, 1994</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Indian Fury 4 – The Gate of Tears&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;19 Feb 1994, 0400 Zulu, 0800 Local&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;This is the fourth scenario of an 8-10 scenario campaign, and is linked to the Northern Fury Campaign. You may wish to refer to that background document to get a broader picture of the geopolitical setting. While The Red Gate is set in the Indian Ocean/Persian Gulf area, it is happening simultaneously to several others occurring around the globe, and is directly linked to the happening in the Mediterranean. It is not essential to play any of these scenarios prior to taking your place as Commander of CTF 155, but it will be useful to understand the global context. See the Indian Fury background document for further insight on the background and specific issues in this region. The key nuggets are&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;UL style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;The Cold War continued, no thaw in relations. Germany is reunified but causing friction between East &amp;amp; West. WP still alive and doing very well.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;On the 12 Feb 1994, the Winter Olympics in Lillehammer, opened with ominous indications of trouble brewing. Soviet and Eastern Bloc countries were represented at the opening ceremonies but many of their athletes were not present at the start of the actual events the next morning. The Russian Olympic village was empty and initial investigation found that many of the athletes had simply disappeared, while only a few had flown home. Norway ordered the IOC to cancel the games and evacuate the Olympic Village.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Norway has called up its reserves, deployed forces to forward bases and has requested support from NATO and has been under significant attack since about noon on the 13th.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Attacks have occurred around the globe to include significant conventional strikes against costal cities and interior infrastructure in North America.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;It is now the start of the sixth day in a new World War.&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;You’re commanding the newly formed CTF 155 combining diverse forces to secure the island of Socotra and the Bab el Mandeb (BeM), the narrow gateway between the Red Sea and the Gulf of Aden know from ancient times as 'The Gate of Tears'. Your forces will conduct several amphibious and airmobile operations while simultaneously fighting for control of the air and sea in this vital maritime choke point.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;This scenario relies heavily on ‘Cargo Operations’ so you will need the Chains of War DLC to play. &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Designer’s notes:&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;This is a busy and complex scenario, you will need to use your resources efficiently and make the best out of every advantage you have.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;UL style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;You should turn 'special messages' ON and in a Pop-Up.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Please respect the initial ready times for aircraft, this represents designed delays that both balance the scenario and paint the picture of routine air operations where machinery breaks and requires preventive maintenance inspections and repairs.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;You have many problems ahead of you and not a lot of time, recommend you start immediately and plan your operations well in advance. You can expect the political and military situation around you to evolve and throw a few surprises your way.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Recommend that you have a word or text document open in the background to allow you to cut and paste the numerous special messages you will receive. This will allow you to refer to them later at your leisure to double check details of tasking or assignments.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Points are allotted or deducted for losses, and for accomplishing assigned tasks.&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Created by Bart Gauvin: AKA Gunner98&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
